d to  staying open and sharing with others and  while for the most part this has been  effective we want to do more we want to  help make this as simple as possible for  those that are ready to take the next  steps and start to think in Cloud native  terms and make the most out of their  Cloud adoption  to be successful every organization  should create their own tailored path  towards their ideal Cloud State based on  their starting point level of comfort  and unique business needs and this my  friends brings us to camp this framework  focuses on helping our customers build  their own unique paths and apply proven  methodologies in a structured phased  approach to implement the right Tech  right processes and people related  improvements the program is designed to  help organizations discover existing  challenges and plan a course of action  that starts with the most impactful  areas of improvement  the idea is to create an iterative  approach where change is applied in  meaningful and manageable intervals on a  continuous basis how do we do that  when it comes to modernization in our  experience customers require support in  three distinct areas  first organization may want to improve  their current applications and rethink  past strategies think about the  applications that are still running on  Mainframe platforms or traditional Java  and net apps that can be containerized  for ease of management  organizations are also interested in  understanding how to build and operate  their applications using the latest  development patterns and tooling this  could include developer productivity  tools modern cice approaches software  security and even cultural and process  related topics like devops and SRE  principles and last but certainly not  least it's important to get exposed to  Advanced design topics that allow for  more flexible and performant application  designs for the future for example  designing applications that can freely  run out any cloud or Advanced usage of  apis as a tool for application expansion  by providing Hands-On workshops and  interactive sessions in each area we  helped expose decision makers and  Technologies to emerging tool sets and  processes they can deploy to achieve  their desired results  organizations are also able to choose  their level of Engagement and match  their comfort level in time and dollar  Investments as they get comfortable with  their chosen approach for customers that  need guidance on where to start they  offer a variety of Assessments covering  topics from applications and platforms  to people and processes  let's look at an example devops is a Hot  Topic that many are interested in  getting better at but it's also a  relatively New Concept in 2018 Google  acquired Dora which stands for devops  research and assessment This research is  one of the longest running efforts  focusing on devops as part of camp for  customers that are wondering about a  better devops posture they offer a  devops assessment backed by the dura  research helping organizations compare  themselves to others in the industry and  identifying how to improve most often  the improvements can be addressed by  adapting the right Tooling in which case  we will help educate the right teams and  make sure that the right resources are  available to help with any deployments  if you'd like to learn more about the  framework please download our white  paper for a deeper look and visit our  websites where we cover each solution  area in more depth and you can access  other videos in this series speaking of  the camp video series please stay tuned  and make sure you watch our upcoming  videos where they'll cover gke  optimization best practices and tools  for containers development and  modernizing Legacy applications  exciting stuff with that I want to thank  you for your time and encourage you to  get in touch with us to get started with  your camping Adventures  foreign
 

